# Viscoelastic 3D matrix, parameters from the reference thesis, section 8.2.5.
# Newtonian bubble in an Oldroyd-B medium; tank raised to height 3 so the walls
# do not influence the tensor; final time 4 because viscoelasticity takes longer
# to reach steady state.
lambda beta polimero esperado
0.1 0.8 {20 percent} {ellipsoidal, as Newtonian}
0.1 0.5 {50 percent} {ellipsoidal}
0.1 0.2 {80 percent} {ellipsoidal}
0.4 0.8 {20 percent} {ellipsoidal, slight stretching}
0.4 0.5 {50 percent} {intermediate stretching}
0.4 0.2 {80 percent} {CUSP at the trailing edge}
